          explanation: 'The Ravana Samhita\'s Ayurvedic definition of health and disease. Health is not the absence of symptoms but the dynamic equilibrium (sāmya) of vata, pitta, and kapha. Disease (vyādhi) is not an enemy to be fought but a signal of imbalance (vaiṣamyam). The treatment (cikitsā) is the restoration of equilibrium, not merely symptom suppression. This is holistic medicine in the truest sense: the physician treats not the disease but the person\'s inner balance.',
